{"id":"bray_curtis","title":"Bray-Curtis dissimilarity","family":"lock-step","definition":"reference","intro_en":"Bray-Curtis divides a total absolute discrepancy by a total combined magnitude. The denominator is global, unlike Canberra's coordinate-specific denominators. On the positive illustration it measures discrepancy relative to the combined mass. The displayed calculation uses the exact absolute-sum denominator in the imported registry and SciPy definition.","intro_zh":"Bray-Curtis 用总绝对差除以整体合并幅值。其分母是全局的，与 Canberra 逐坐标归一化不同。本例输入为正值，结果表示相对合并总量的差异；所示公式采用导入登记表及 SciPy 的绝对和分母。","steps_en":["Keep the two series on the same sample grid; no shift or warping is estimated.","Accumulate absolute gaps; the highlighted point supplies one coordinate contribution.","Accumulate the coordinate contributions in sample order.","Divide by the fixed total abs(x+y)."],"steps_zh":["在同一采样网格上比较两条序列，不估计平移或时间规整。","计算各坐标的绝对残差。","按采样顺序累积局部贡献。","用绝对差总和除以固定的 sum(abs(x+y))。"],"formula":"sum_i abs(x_i-y_i) / sum_i abs(x_i+y_i)","caveats_en":["Signed data can cause a zero or small denominator; the usual bounded interpretation assumes nonnegative data.","Sample alignment and amplitude units are part of the comparison protocol."],"caveats_zh":["带符号数据可能使分母为零或很小；通常的有界解释依赖非负输入。","采样对齐和幅值单位属于比较协议的一部分。"],"sources":[{"label":"SciPy: braycurtis","url":"https://docs.scipy.org/doc/scipy/reference/generated/scipy.spatial.distance.braycurtis.html"}],"x":[1.0,1.5,2.4,3.7,4.5,3.8,2.6,2.1,2.8,3.8,4.1,3.3],"y":[1.3,1.8,2.0,3.2,5.2,4.4,2.9,1.6,2.6,3.1,4.4,3.9],"input_label":"Deterministic synthetic illustration; sample index is the time axis.","parameters":{"samples":12,"preprocessing":"none","domain":"strictly positive illustration","global_denominator":72.0},"result":{"label":"distance","value":0.07500000000000001,"detail":"Exact formula evaluation on the displayed aligned vectors."},"frames":[{"phase":0,"caption":"Aligned samples","panel":{"kind":"lines","title":"Aligned samples","a":[1.0,1.5],"a_label":"x"